this is basically a gala.

02:15.735 --> 02:18.639
-Aw. You look nice.
-Thank you.

02:18.705 --> 02:21.875
-Very Phantom Thread.
-Oh, thanks.

02:21.942 --> 02:23.577
-Never seen it.
-No, me neither.

02:23.644 --> 02:24.744
-Billie.
-Yeah.

02:24.811 --> 02:26.847
